{"id":"voru_bergehend","lemma":"vorübergehend","pos":"adj","rank":3340,"glosses":["temporary"],"ipa":"/foˈʁyːbɐɡeːənt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/09/De-at-vor%C3%BCbergehend.ogg/De-at-vor%C3%BCbergehend.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das ist nur vorübergehend.","en":"It's only temporary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567017","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"only"},null]},{"text":"Die Toilette ist vorübergehend geschlossen.","en":"The toilet is temporarily closed.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"toilet"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"shut"}]},{"text":"Sie sagten, die Situation sei nur vorübergehend.","en":"They said the situation was only temporary.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"situation"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"only"},null]},{"text":"Diese Regelung besteht nur vorübergehend.","en":"This arrangement is only temporary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717997","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"regulation"},{"g":"to succeed, to pass","l":"bestehen"},{"g":"only"},null]},{"text":"Sie haben gesagt, das sei nur vorübergehend.","en":"They said this was just temporary.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"only"},null]}]}